# Normalise to LF in the repository, always.
#
# Development happens on Windows and CI builds on Linux. Without this, files get
# committed with CRLF and shell scripts inside containers fail with errors that
# point nowhere near the real cause.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never touch these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.wasm binary

# Generated. Committed so `go build` works on a clean checkout without the
# generator installed, but excluded from diffs and language stats.
*_templ.go linguist-generated=true
*.sql.go   linguist-generated=true
docs/spec/** linguist-documentation=true
